<title>USA: IXC signs $27 mln contract.</title>
<headline>IXC signs $27 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>IXC Communications Inc said on Thursday a major long-distance company has signed a one-year contract worth about $27 million to provide private line services between various cities.</p>
<p>The contract represents one of IXC's largest commitments to date for high-speed bandwidth, the company said.</p>
<p>The name of the long-distance company was not disclosed.</p>
</text>
